in="00:24.450" end="00:24.720">there's </span><span begin="00:24.720" end="00:25.230">just </span><span begin="00:25.230" end="00:25.650">one </span><span begin="00:25.650" end="00:26.250">problem</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.250" end="00:28.200"><span begin="00:26.250" end="00:26.550">I'm </span><span begin="00:26.550" end="00:26.670">a </span><span begin="00:26.670" end="00:27.120">bit </span><span begin="00:27.120" end="00:27.330">old </span><span begin="00:27.330" end="00:28.200">school</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.230" end="00:30.180"><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.530">When </span><span begin="00:28.530" end="00:28.650">it </span><span begin="00:28.650" end="00:29.190">comes </span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.580">to </span><span begin="00:29.580" end="00:30.180">lovin'</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.180" end="00:32.340"><span begin="00:30.180" end="00:30.450">I </span><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.660">ain't </span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:31.410">chasing </span><span begin="00:31.410" end="00:32.340">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.150" end="00:34.200"><span begin="00:33.150" end="00:33.600">Hate </span><span begin="00:33.600" end="00:34.200">waiting</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.650" end="00:36.270"><span begin="00:34.650" end="00:34.950">I'm </span><span begin="00:34.950" end="00:35.190">on </span><span begin="00:35.190" end="00:35.310">a </span><span begin="00:35.310" end="00:36.270">roll</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.300" end="00:40.590"><span begin="00:36.300" end="00:36.600">You've </span><span begin="00:36.600" end="00:36.990">got </span><span begin="00:36.990" end="00:37.290">to </span><span begin="00:37.290" end="00:37.770">let </span><span begin="00:37.770" end="00:38.520">yourself </span><span begin="00:38.520" end="00:40.590">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.590" end="00:42.720"><span begin="00:40.590" end="00:42.720">Whoa</span></p><p ttm:agent